7. This order will remain operative subject to compliance of the following conditions by the applicant:-
i) The applicant will comply with all the terms and conditions of the bond executed by him;
ii) The applicant will cooperate in the investigation/trial, as the case may be;
iii) The applicant will not indulge himself in extending inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-GWL:2758 3 MCRC-441-2025 dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the Court or to the Police Officer, as the case may be;
iv) The applicant will not commit any other offence or will not repeat the offence in future.

